# Members-only content is meant to be reached exclusively through its
# Cloudflare Pages Function gate (/member-area, /member-area/chart), which
# fetches these exact files via the env.ASSETS binding - an internal fetch
# that bypasses this file. These rules block the underlying filenames from
# being served directly to anyone hitting the raw URL.
#
# Requests for the .html form get Cloudflare's automatic clean-URL 308 to
# the extensionless form BEFORE these rules are evaluated, so the rule has
# to target the extensionless path - blocking the .html form directly does
# nothing, the redirect happens first regardless.
/members-research           /founder-beta.html   403
/members-weekly-goldturns   /founder-beta.html   403
